  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large deep skillet or Dutch oven over medium heat. Add the onion and cook for 4 minutes, until soft.",
    "Stir in the garlic and ginger and cook for 30 seconds, until fragrant.",
    "Add the chicken, salt, and pepper. Cook for 4 minutes, stirring, until the outside is no longer pink.",
    "Stir in the curry powder, cumin, and turmeric. Cook for 1 minute so the spices toast.",
    "Add the tomatoes, coconut milk, chickpeas, and water. Scrape up any browned bits from the bottom of the pot.",
    "Bring to a gentle boil, then reduce the heat to medium-low. Simmer uncovered for 15 minutes, stirring now and then, until the sauce thickens.",
    "Check that the chicken reads 165 F in the thickest piece. Taste and add more salt if needed.",
    "Serve hot. The curry thickens as it sits, so add a splash of water when reheating leftovers."
  ],
